/users/Zshandi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T19:21:37Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T19:22:31Z","body":"> This essentially reverts https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81076 , and by extension also reopens https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/81057 ?\n\nI believe it would, though perhaps we should test it. There is also another issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80755 which was closed from that PR and is probably now reverted.\n\nHowever, I believe those issues would be better addressed by updating the individual components which shouldn't allow such values, rather than range as a whole.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2839983462/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840012921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105911#issuecomment-2840012921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105911","id":2840012921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pRyh5","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T19:29:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T19:29:09Z","body":"#80755 was fixed with a better fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2840012921/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844144980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105911#issuecomment-2844144980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105911","id":2844144980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6phjVU","user":{"login":"Zshandi","id":28741838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzQxODM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28741838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi","html_url":"https://github.com/Zshandi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zshandi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T05:38:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T05:38:50Z","body":"@KoBeWi should we reopen #81057 then?\n\nMy thoughts are, since spinbox allows for expressions as @AThousandShips pointed out, and these expressions can result in NAN, it makes sense to allow just NAN. The statement you made in that issue about it only being for numerical input then is also immaculate due to this fact.\n\nHowever, I do see that it would be useful to have options to disallow NAN or INF (separately), and perhaps even an option to only allow numbers to be input. This gives the control to the developer, and also makes it more obvious this needs to be accounted for. It could also maybe default to only numeric input?\n\nPerhaps that should be added as a separate feature request though, with an immediate action that could easily be taken being to update the documentation to address this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844144980/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844360674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105911#issuecomment-2844360674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105911","id":2844360674,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6piX_i","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","fol